# Plan screenshots. Binary: no line-ending conversion, no attempted diffs or
# merges. See Skills/NewWork.md for the size rules that keep this folder small.
#
# Listed by extension rather than as Plans/Assets/**, which would also catch the
# README that lives there and make git report a perfectly readable text file as
# an unreadable binary blob.
Plans/Assets/*.png  binary
Plans/Assets/*.jpg  binary
Plans/Assets/*.jpeg binary
Plans/Assets/*.gif  binary
Plans/Assets/*.webp binary
